    "Parse": "Analizar",
    "Draw": "Dibujar",
    "Cancel": "Cancelar",
    "Decoding…": "Decodificando…",
    "samples": "muestras",
    "Handing over the samples…": "Entregando las muestras…",
    "Building charts and table…": "Construyendo gráficas y tabla…",
